			Paragraph: The Saturday market returns to the main square with more stalls than ever: vegetables from the market gardens, cheese from the hills and bread from the wood-fired oven of the old bakery.
			Paragraph: The residents' association is also organizing a walk along the river, starting from the old bridge at ten in the morning and ending at the mill, where there will be lunch for everyone.
			Paragraph: Registration is open until Friday at the public library, and the walk is free for members.
